      {"t":"type","p":"Please help my friend (use tolong)","a":["Tolong bantu teman saya","Tolong bantu temanku"],"hint":"tolong · bantu · teman","x":["minta"],"why":"The owner comes after the noun: teman saya, and tolong goes before the verb."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Don't go to the market","a":["Jangan pergi ke pasar","Jangan ke pasar"],"hint":"jangan · pergi · pasar","x":["tidak","di"],"why":"jangan gives a 'don't' command, and ke marks where you go."}
